  "text": "You study flesh up close by clashing blade against bone. You gain the reaper's edge and thrall teamwork abilities.\n\nReaper's Edge You become trained in martial weapons and medium armor. At 11th level, you become an expert in martial weapons, and at 13th you become an expert in medium armor.\n\nThrall Teamwork Once per round after you cast Create Thrall, you can make a melee Strike as a free action against a creature within your melee reach that is adjacent to at least one of your thralls.",
